{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09197","headline":"荅李博士 · 韦应物","name":"荅李博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休沐去人远，高斋出林杪。\n晴山多碧峰，颢气疑秋晓。\n端居喜良友，枉使千里路。\n缄书当夏时，开缄时已度。\n檐雏已颻扬，荷露方萧飒。\n梦远竹窗幽，行稀兰径合。\n旧居共南北，往来只如昨。\n问君今爲谁，日夕度清洛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}